          "@id": "bsis:market_regimes"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsis:intraday_regime_history"
        }
      ],
      "bsi:noExternalCounterpart": "platform_specific: HMM state plus a weight-gate role: derived market state on this platform, not an externally-defined regime."
    },
    {
      "@id": "bsi:BreadthObservation",
      "rdf:type": {
        "@id": "owl:Class"
      },
      "rdfs:label": "Breadth observation",
      "rdfs:comment": "Market-wide participation statistics: share of the universe above its 200-day average, advance/decline ratio, net highs minus lows.",
      "bsi:layer": "context",
      "bsi:realization": "table",
      "bsi:grain": "one row per date",
      "bsi:keyProperty": {
        "@id": "bsip:date"
      },
      "bsi:caveat": "Computed over this platform's own universe definition, so the numbers are not comparable to a vendor's breadth series without re-basing.",
      "bsi:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "bsis:market_breadth"
      },
      "bsi:noExternalCounterpart": "platform_specific: Breadth statistics are context filters computed over this platform's own universe definition."
    },
    {
      "@id": "bsi:SectorRotationPoint",
      "rdf:type": {
        "@id": "owl:Class"
      },
      "rdfs:label": "Sector rotation point",
      "rdfs:comment": "Weekly relative-rotation coordinates and quadrant per sector — the intended input to sector-plus-stock relative strength.",
      "bsi:layer": "context",
      "bsi:realization": "table",
      "bsi:grain": "(sector, week_date)",
      "bsi:keyProperty": [
        {
          "@id": "bsip:sector"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsip:week_date"
        }
      ],
      "bsi:caveat": "The sector-to-stock relative-strength link is a RESEARCH CANDIDATE: the master report names it as an experiment, not an established edge.",
      "bsi:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "bsis:sector_rrg_history"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "bsi:PlatformOutput",
      "rdf:type": {
        "@id": "owl:Class"
      },
      "rdfs:label": "Platform output",
      "rdfs:comment": "Abstract parent for anything this platform computes and serves. Every subclass is an OPINION of this system, not an observation of the market.",
      "bsi:layer": "derived",
      "bsi:realization": "abstract",
      "bsi:keyProperty": {
        "@id": "bsip:symbol"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "bsi:FeatureVector",
      "rdf:type": {
        "@id": "owl:Class"
      },
      "rdfs:label": "Feature vector",
      "rdfs:comment": "The rolling per-symbol, per-date feature panel the models train on. Features, not information: they re-express price, flow and vendor data.",
      "bsi:layer": "derived",
      "bsi:realization": "table",
      "bsi:grain": "(symbol, date, timeframe)",
      "rdfs:subClassOf": {
        "@id": "bsi:PlatformOutput"
      },
      "bsi:keyProperty": [
        {
          "@id": "bsip:symbol"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsip:date"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsip:timeframe"
        }
      ],
      "bsi:caveat": [
        "A feature's meaning is defined by `feature_engineering.py` at a specific commit, not by this ontology. Cite the feature version when a result depends on it.",
        "Pre-rebuild rows are not comparable with post-rebuild rows."
      ],
      "bsi:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "bsis:feature_store"
      },
      "bsi:noExternalCounterpart": "platform_specific: `feature_store` columns are re-expressed price and vendor data — features, not financial concepts. Mapping them outward would create false semantic weight and invite a model to treat a derived column as an observed fact."
    },
    {
      "@id": "bsi:TechnicalSignal",
      "rdf:type": {
        "@id": "owl:Class"
      },
      "rdfs:label": "Technical signal",
      "rdfs:comment": "The wide per-symbol, per-date technical panel: indicators, regime stamp, flow and fundamental context columns, plus the model's probability outputs.",
      "bsi:layer": "derived",
      "bsi:realization": "table",
      "bsi:grain": "(symbol, date)",
      "rdfs:subClassOf": {
        "@id": "bsi:PlatformOutput"
      },
      "bsi:keyProperty": [
        {
          "@id": "bsip:symbol"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsip:date"
        }
      ],
      "bsi:caveat": [
        "Over 300 columns of mixed provenance: raw indicators, vendor opinions (ext_* / mc_* / tl_* prefixes) and model outputs sit side by side. The binding table marks which is which.",
        "`win_probability` and `calibrated_win_probability` are model OUTPUTS and must not be fed back in as features."
      ],
      "bsi:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "bsis:technical_signals"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "bsi:EngineScore",
      "rdf:type": {
        "@id": "owl:Class"
      },
      "rdfs:label": "Engine score",
      "rdfs:comment": "A single engine's, or the multi-engine composite's, score for a symbol and date with its engine-coverage count.",
      "bsi:layer": "derived",
      "bsi:realization": "table",
      "bsi:grain": "(symbol, date)",
      "rdfs:subClassOf": {
        "@id": "bsi:PlatformOutput"
      },
      "bsi:keyProperty": [
        {
          "@id": "bsip:symbol"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsip:date"
        }
      ],
      "bsi:caveat": "Engine contributions are measured here, not assumed: only the confluence engine carries a growing positive reading, the ML ensemble adds roughly +0.02, and the DL / cross-sectional / smart-money engines measured 0.0 across all regimes.",
      "bsi:realizedBy": [
        {
          "@id": "bsis:confluence_signals"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsis:engine_composite_scores"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsis:stock_scores"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "bsi:Recommendation",
      "rdf:type": {
        "@id": "owl:Class"
      },
      "rdfs:label": "Recommendation",
      "rdfs:comment": "The served trade: composite score, conviction bucket, action label, entry zone, stop, targets, risk/reward and position size for one symbol, date and timeframe.",
      "bsi:layer": "derived",
      "bsi:realization": "table",
      "bsi:grain": "(symbol, computed_at, timeframe)",
      "rdfs:subClassOf": {
        "@id": "bsi:PlatformOutput"
      },
      "bsi:keyProperty": [
        {
          "@id": "bsip:symbol"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsip:computed_at"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsip:timeframe"
        }
      ],
      "bsi:caveat": [
        "`computed_at` is TEXT here and native TIMESTAMPTZ in `confluence_signals` — cast before joining the two.",
        "`trade_reasoning` is generated text: an explanation, never evidence.",
        "The history table carries the raw meta-label behind `position_size_pct`, which the serving table does not."
      ],
      "bsi:realizedBy": [
        {
          "@id": "bsis:unified_recommendations"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsis:unified_recommendations_history"
        },
        {
          "@id": "bsis:intraday_recommendations"
        }
      ],
      "bsi:noExternalCounterpart": "platform_specific: `unified_score` is a composite of this platform's engines with a tracked per-engine track record. FIBO's nearest analogue is a research recommendation — a different object with a different lifecycle and no track record."
    },
    {
      "@id": "bsi:ModelArtifact",
      "rdf:type": {
        "@id": "owl:Class"
      },
      "rdfs:label": "Model artifact",
      "rdfs:comment": "A registered trained model: type, version, evaluation metrics, feature count, horizon and active flag.",
      "bsi:layer": "derived",
      "bsi:realization": "table",
      "bsi:grain": "one row per version",
      "rdfs:subClassOf": {
        "@id": "bsi:PlatformOutput"
      },
      "bsi:keyProperty": {
        "@id": "bsip:id"
      },
      "bsi:caveat": "Promotion is gated on holdout error plus a margin; a row existing does not mean the model is serving.",
      "bsi:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "bsis:model_registry"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "bsi:FeatureImportance",
