        "@id": "fibo-fnd-acc-cur:MonetaryAmount"
      },
      "bsi:alignmentRationale": "[fibo-fnd-acc-cur:MonetaryAmount] Block-deal value held in CRORES as a bare float. FIBO requires amount plus currency; our column carries neither, so a consumer must know the multiplier out of band. Exactly the ambiguity this alignment exists to surface.",
