        "calibrated_win_probability",
        "ai_insight"
      ],
      "bsi:caveat": [
        "Over 300 columns of MIXED provenance: raw indicators, vendor opinions (ext_* / mc_* / tl_* prefixes) and model outputs sit side by side. Use the binding table to tell them apart.",
