        "trendlyne_screener_discovery.py"
      ],
      "bsi:caveat": [
        "Sentiment, category and tier are INFERRED by this platform: model output about a vendor product, not vendor metadata.",
        "A screener is a candidate generator, never evidence — the aggregate momentum score derived from these no longer clears the USABLE bar."
      ],
