    {
      "@id": "bsis:nse_stocks",
      "rdf:type": {
        "@id": "bsi:Table"
      },
      "rdfs:label": "NSE listing snapshot",
      "rdfs:comment": "One row per NSE ticker carrying ISIN, sector, industry, venue, index-membership flags, lot size and the vendor id cross-references (mcsymbol, trendlyne, tickertape, fincode, scripcode). The richest identity table in the database.",
      "bsi:realizes": {
        "@id": "bsi:Equity"
      },
      "bsi:rowClass": {
        "@id": "bsit:nse_stocks"
      },
      "bsi:grain": "(symbol)",
      "bsi:cadence": "daily",
      "bsi:trainingUse": "context",
      "bsi:primaryKey": "symbol",
      "bsi:freshnessColumn": "last_updated",
      "bsi:writtenBy": [
        "scripts/syncAllStockMappings.ts",
        "scripts/sync_mc_scid_map.py"
      ],
      "bsi:caveat": [
        "NO SINGLE WRITER OWNS A ROW: the vendor-id columns, the sector/industry columns, the surveillance flags and the index-membership flags are each patched by a different job, each with its own `*_updated_at` stamp, so a row is a merge of several ages.",
        "`market_cap` is vendor-computed and its unit is NOT declared in the schema (`market_cap` records `INR_or_crore_UNDECLARED`).",
        "`is_asm`, `gsm_stage` and every `is_nifty*`/`is_midcap*` flag is a 0/1 INTEGER, not a boolean.",
        "Index-membership flags are current snapshots, not survivorship-free history: they cannot reconstruct a past universe."
      ],
      "bsi:hasColumn": [
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_symbol"
        },
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_name"
        },
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_isin"
        },
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_sector"
        },
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_industry"
        },
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_exchange"
        },
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_market_cap"
        },
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_lot_size"
        },
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_is_asm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "_:col_nse_stocks_last_updated"
        }
      ]
    },
